Voxa
====

Voxa is a standalone self-hosted speech-to-text product. It vendors its own
transcription engine in `voxa/engine/`, forked from faster-whisper. Voxa does
not depend on any external faster-whisper package.

Copyright (c) 2026 the Voxa authors.
